<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>The comments indicate that there are three types of effect: engine, mixed and scripted.
</p>
<ul><li> Engine effect: the effect constructor and destructor is handled by engine</li>
<li> Mixed effects: the effect constructor is handled by both engine and scripts</li></ul>
